{
  "_doc": "Neutral default-profile seed for /ai-briefing. Public, official AI-vendor and framework accounts only — no personal curation. Copy into .claude/ai-briefing/[<profile>/]following-list.json (via /ai-briefing:setup) and tailor it; `--refresh-following` re-scrapes your own following graph into the profile copy. `accounts.*` are semantic buckets; `scan_priority.*` are the scan tiers the runner reads. A handle may appear in both.",
